    {
      "q": "How does picturing help me remember?",
      "a": "Brains remember pictures very well. Drawing a word or imagining a film gives your brain a picture to hold.",
      "asks": [
        "Tell me about Picture it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "q": "What is chunking?",
      "a": "Chunking means splitting a long list into small groups, like 472 913 instead of 472913. Small chunks are easier to hold.",
      "asks": [
        "Tell me about Chunk it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "q": "What is Roy G Biv?",
